#. type: Title #
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote access (Service API Token + LAN / local HTTPS)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Habitat 业务 API（Habitat RPC `POST|WS /rpc/v1` + MCP）须带 **per-subject Service API Token**（`Authorization: Bearer fa_at_...` 或 WS `connect.auth_token`）。\n"
"> Security context: [`security.md`](security.md) · Install: [`install.md`](install.md)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer                    | Role                                                                                                                                   |\n"
"| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Service API Token**    | 绑定 `user` / `agent` subject；Habitat RPC HTTP `Authorization: Bearer`；WS `connect.auth_token`；MCP `/mcp` 同 Bearer                 |\n"
"| **CLI bootstrap**        | `anima token create --subject-id <id> --name bootstrap`（直连 PG，不经 HTTP）                                                          |\n"
"| **`http.host`**          | Habitat listen bind (IP or resolvable hostname); default `127.0.0.1`; use `0.0.0.0` for LAN                                            |\n"
"| **`http.allowed_hosts`** | TLS 证书 SAN 额外主机名 / IP（`http.host: 0.0.0.0` 时列出客户端访问用的名称）；变更后 `auto: true` 时重启自动重签                      |\n"
"| **`http.cors_origins`**  | Explicit cross-origin browser origins (`just dev web`, split UI/API reverse proxy)                                                     |\n"
"| **Client settings**      | Desktop / mobile shell / **browser Web** fill Habitat URL and token in **Habitat settings**                                            |\n"
"| **Remote UI**            | 浏览器/PWA 从 Habitat `/web/*` 加载；Desktop/Mobile 默认安装包内本地 UI；见 [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md) Client UI |\n"
"| **PWA**                  | `/web/*` 支持 manifest + Service Worker；手机浏览器与 APK 共用 compact 布局                                                            |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:24
msgid ""
"公网暴露不在产品内置范围内：请使用局域网、`http.tls` 本地 HTTPS，或自行搭建反"
"向代理 / VPN。旧版 `tunnel` 配置段已废弃并忽略。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "PWA（浏览器 Web）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**Secure context**：Service Worker 需要 HTTPS 或 `localhost`。局域网可用 "
"Habitat 本地 HTTPS（`:2659`）或自建 TLS 终止。浏览器 **Web Speech** 朗读同样"
"需安全上下文；默认 **Edge TTS**（Habitat `POST /rpc/v1/tts/synthesize`）在 "
"HTTP 局域网下也可用，但 Habitat 需能访问外网 Microsoft 语音服务。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**Service Worker vs 安装**：SW 在普通浏览器标签页访问 `/web/*` 时即注册（生产"
"构建）；**不要求**「添加到主屏幕」。安装仅改变启动方式（独立窗口），离线能力"
"与标签页相同。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**安装（可选）**：手机浏览器访问 `/web/chat`，Chrome / Safari 支持「添加到主"
"屏幕」；生产构建会显示安装引导条（compact 布局、非已安装态）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**更新**：Habitat 部署新 Web 静态产物后，已安装 PWA 会提示「新版本可用」；点"
"击重新加载后生效（不会自动刷新）。壳层 JS 由 Workbox precache，生产环境会定"
"期/`visibilitychange` 时 `registration.update()`。`/web/config.json` 始终 "
"`no-store`（Habitat URL 动态）。Desktop/Mobile 不走 SW；升级见 Releases 安装"
"包检测（设置 → 关于「检查更新」）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:36
msgid "**离线边界（两层）**："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**壳层（SW）**：仅缓存 JS/CSS/HTML 等静态资源，保证断网时页面框架可加载。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**业务快照（IndexedDB）**：Chat / Task / Project / Notification / Diary / "
"Email / Dream / Pomodoro（config/历史）及 Habitat UI 部分只读页由 `shell-sdk/"
"offline-cache` 做 **在线栖息地优先 / 离线 snapshot**；**outbox 模块**"
"（Diary、Task、Project）在线写直连 Habitat（`preferOnlineWrite`），离线或网络"
"失败走 outbox；Chat send / Pomodoro 仍有各自 outbox 路径；详见 [`offline-"
"platform.md`](offline-platform.md)。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**离线边界**：浏览器 `offline` 时 snapshot 模块只读展示快照；"
"**offlineWritable** 模块（Diary、Task、Project、Chat、Pomodoro）仍可本地编辑"
"并排队待同步。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**存储**：SW 缓存、localStorage（Habitat 设置）、IndexedDB（业务快照）互不冲"
"突；清除站点数据会同时删除三者。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:38
msgid ""
"Registry 标记 `auth: optional` 的 Habitat RPC 方法（如 `health.probe`、"
"`tls.ca.*`）与 CORS 预检可不带 Bearer；其余 `/rpc/v1/*` 与 MCP 须 Bearer。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. 创建 token（冷启动）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima token create --subject-id 1 --name bootstrap\n"
"# 终端打印 fa_at_...（仅此一次）→ 填入客户端 Habitat 设置\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:47
msgid "列出 / 撤销："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima token list --subject-id 1\n"
"anima token revoke <token_id>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:54
msgid "Habitat Habitat RPC REST（需已认证 `full` token）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:58
msgid ""
"`GET /rpc/v1/tokens/listForSubject?id=:id`（或 "
"`createTypedHabitatClient().call(\"tokens.listForSubject\", { id })`）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:58
msgid ""
"`POST /rpc/v1/tokens/createForSubject` — body `{ \"id\": <subject_id>, "
"\"name\": \"desktop\" }`，响应含一次性 `plaintext`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:58
msgid "`POST /rpc/v1/tokens/revoke` — body `{ \"id\": <token_id> }`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Listen address (`http.host`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default bind is `127.0.0.1:2658` (loopback only). For LAN access via `http://<PC-IP>:2658/web` or a local hostname such as `http://galaxy:2658/web`, set:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host: 0.0.0.0\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:69
msgid ""
"Multiple binds (distinct interfaces only — not client-facing aliases). Use "
"`0.0.0.0` instead of listing every IP; do not mix `0.0.0.0` with specific "
"addresses. Hostnames must resolve on the Habitat machine (`/etc/hosts` or "
"DNS):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host:\n"
"    - 127.0.0.1\n"
"    - 10.244.0.2\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:78
msgid ""
"CLI `--host` overrides config for a single run / systemd unit write. After "
"changing `http.host`, run `anima service restart`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "LAN: `http://<PC-IP>:2658/web/chat` with `http.host: 0.0.0.0` (or `anima service start --host 0.0.0.0`); clients set Habitat URL to `http://<PC-IP>:2658` (no `/web` suffix).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cross-origin (`http.cors_origins`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:84
msgid ""
"When the browser UI and Habitat API share the same origin (e.g. Habitat `/"
"web` + same-host `/api`), **no CORS config is needed**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:86
msgid ""
"Add origins only for **cross-origin** cases (e.g. Vite dev server, external "
"reverse proxy splitting UI and API):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  cors_origins:\n"
"    - http://127.0.0.1:4173\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:94
msgid "CORS is **not** derived from `web.public_url`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Habitat 本地 HTTPS（双端口，可选）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:98
msgid ""
"Habitat 可在 **独立端口** 提供原生 TLS（`Bun.serve`），与默认 HTTP 并行："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 端口     | 协议  | 用途                                                                                      |\n"
"| -------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **2658** | HTTP  | 默认；CLI 探活、日常客户端、局域网访问                                                    |\n"
"| **2659** | HTTPS | 本地/局域网安全上下文（Web Speech / PWA 等）；客户端 Habitat URL 填 `https://<host>:2659` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:105
msgid "启用（`~/.anima/config.yaml` bootstrap 段）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host: 0.0.0.0\n"
"  allowed_hosts:\n"
"    - feng-vm.lan\n"
"    - 10.200.200.10\n"
"  tls:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    port: 2659\n"
"    auto: true\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:120
msgid ""
"**`auto: true`**（默认）：首次启动在 `~/.anima/tls/` 自动生成 cert/key（优先 "
"**mkcert**，否则 **openssl 自签**）；SAN 含 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1`、"
"`http.host` 中的 bind 地址（跳过 `0.0.0.0`）及 **`http.allowed_hosts`**。配置"
"变更导致 SAN 不足时，**重启 Habitat 会自动删除旧证书并重签**（`auto: false` "
"时仅告警，不覆盖手动证书）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:120
msgid ""
"**探活**：`anima service status` 与 `GET /rpc/v1/health/probe` 仍走 HTTP "
"`:2658`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkcert root CA on clients (optional)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:124
msgid ""
"The Habitat server certificate lives on the Habitat host. Browsers, "
"**desktop shell**, and mobile APKs need the **mkcert root CA** "
"(`rootCA.pem`, not `cert.pem`) in the OS trust store for HTTPS `:2659` "
"without warnings:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:127
msgid ""
"**设置 → 连接** (`/web/settings?section=habitat`): download **rootCA.pem** "
"and a **QR code** (QR points at the HTTP `:2658` download URL so you can "
"scan before trusting HTTPS)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:127
msgid ""
"If HTTPS pages still fail to load scripts, open settings via **`http://"
"<host>:2658/web/settings?section=habitat`** first."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkcert -CAROOT   # path to rootCA.pem on the Habitat host\n"
"mkcert -install  # trust that CA on the Habitat host itself\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:136
msgid ""
"**Desktop shell**: install `rootCA.pem` into the **OS** trust store (same "
"machine as the desktop app). Install the CA into the OS trust store so Tauri "
"WebView / system TLS trust Habitat HTTPS. On the Habitat host after `mkcert "
"-install`, no extra step is usually needed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:136
msgid ""
"**iOS**: AirDrop/email `rootCA.pem` → install the profile → **Settings → "
"General → About → Certificate Trust Settings** → enable full trust."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:136
msgid ""
"**Android**: optionally convert to DER, then **Settings → Security → Install "
"CA certificate**. Tauri Android builds also need a build that trusts user "
"CAs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:138
msgid ""
"Daily LAN access: **HTTP `:2658`** or **HTTPS `:2659` (after CA trust)**; "
"for the public Internet use your own reverse proxy or VPN."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Client configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Portal** (`src/app/shell/tauri`) and **browser Web** (`src/app/shell/web`) are remote clients; they **do not read** Habitat `config.yaml` token.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:148
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Client        | Storage                                              |\n"
"| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Desktop shell | `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json` (`habitat` section) |\n"
"| Mobile shell  | Tauri prefs / store                                  |\n"
"| Browser Web   | localStorage (settings page)                         |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:150
msgid "Settings (all clients):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:153
msgid ""
"**Habitat URL** — e.g. `http://192.168.1.10:2658` or `https://<lan-"
"host>:2659` (Habitat root, **without** `/web`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:153
msgid "**Habitat API Token** — `fa_at_...` from `anima token create`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:155
msgid ""
"Browser Web: `/web/config.json` defaults Habitat to the **page origin** "
"(production Habitat-hosted `/web` and Vite `just dev web`). Source `just dev "
"habitat` writes `~/.anima/dev-web.token`; Vite injects it as "
"`remote_auth_token` so the first visit need not paste a token. Production "
"Habitat never puts tokens in `config.json` — use `anima token create` and "
"Habitat settings."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:157
msgid ""
"Flow: open Habitat settings → fill → **Test connection** → Save. Desktop "
"requires **restart desktop shell** after save."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:158
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Authentication behavior"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:160
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"REST:  Authorization: Bearer fa_at_<prefix>_<secret>\n"
"Habitat RPC: WebSocket /rpc/v1 → connect frame includes auth_token\n"
"MCP:   POST/GET /mcp → Authorization: Bearer <token>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:167
msgid ""
"`/web/*` static assets skip service auth; `/api` and `/mcp` require Bearer "
"token."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:169
msgid "Missing or invalid token → HTTP `401` or Habitat RPC connection closed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. MCP outbound (external agents query Habitat data)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:173
msgid ""
"Habitat serves Streamable HTTP MCP Server at **`/mcp`**, exposing tools with "
"`exposeMcp: true`. Current outbound surface is **task item** tools only "
"(`task_*`: create/update/complete/uncomplete/delete/get/list/search); task "
"lists, projects, and folders stay Habitat-only. Other ToolSets remain "
"available inside Habitat chat but are not listed on `/mcp`. External MCP "
"clients (Cursor, Claude Desktop, etc.) connect **without LLM relay**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:174
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# External agent example (Cursor mcp.json, etc.)\n"
"mcpServers:\n"
"  freeanima:\n"
"    url: http://127.0.0.1:2658/mcp\n"
"    headers:\n"
"      Authorization: \"Bearer fa_at_...\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:185
msgid ""
"**Inbound** (Habitat connects to external MCP servers): runtime "
"`mcp_servers` (`src/capabilities/mcp-client`); manage in Habitat UI `/"
"habitat/mcp`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:185
msgid ""
"**Outbound** (external agents call Habitat tools): `/mcp` endpoint (`src/"
"capabilities/mcp-server`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:186
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:193
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command                          | Description                                  |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `anima token create/list/revoke` | Service API Token 管理（CLI，直连 PG）       |\n"
"| `anima web start --foreground`   | Standalone Web static server (debug, `/web`) |\n"
"| `anima service status`           | Habitat stack status                         |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/remote-access.md:203
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                | Check                                                                    |\n"
"| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Cannot reach Habitat   | Is Habitat running? `anima service status`; check `http.host` / firewall |\n"
"| 401                    | Client token valid; run `anima token list --subject-id <id>`             |\n"
"| Local OK, remote fails | Remote requests need Bearer / SAP auth_token                             |\n"
"| CORS error in browser  | Add UI origin to `http.cors_origins`, or use Habitat `/web` same-origin  |\n"
"| 401 after token change | Update client settings; revoke old tokens if needed                      |\n"
msgstr ""

